      "markdown": "## Module 9\n\n3.Don't forget to  $ \\underline{\\text{tell}} $ (letl) him the good news(消息).\n\n4.I don't know the way. You can  $ \\underline{\\text{ask}} $ (ska) the policeman.\n\n5. There are some  $ \\underline{\\text{women}} $ (mewon) under the tree.\n\n6.I want to  $ \\underline{\\text{borrow}} $ (rowbor) a book from the library.\n\n## 九、 根据图示仿写句子。(6分)\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_223_656_357_753.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_457_647_586_749.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_716_646_848_736.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\nI had noodles yesterday.\n\nI am having a sandwich now.\n\nI am going to have a hamburger tomorrow.\n\n1.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_192_1087_301_1198.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_430_1075_546_1188.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_693_1045_815_1211.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\nI played football yesterday.\n\n2.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_201_1505_375_1643.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_482_1493_626_1647.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_719_1496_963_1646.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\nI read some books yesterday.\n\nI am flying a kite now.\n\nI am going to ride a bike tomorrow.\n\n## 十、 选择适当的单词补全短文,将其序号填在相应的横线上。(10 分)\n\nDear Kalulu,\n\nLast 1.  $ \\underline{E} $, we went to a 2.  $ \\underline{C} $ theatre. There was an interesting 3.  $ \\underline{H} $ there. The 4.  $ \\underline{D} $ told a lot of 5.  $ \\underline{I} $. We 6.  $ \\underline{B} $ a lot. After that we had a big 7.  $ \\underline{A} $. We took many 8.  $ \\underline{G} $. Would you like to see them? How 9.  $ \\underline{J} $ we were!\n\nWrite to me 10.  $ \\underline{F} $.\n\nMa Xiaotiao",
